# Local output and media.
#
# NOTE: the bare pattern "Transcription/" used to live here. On a
# case-insensitive filesystem git sets core.ignorecase=true, so it also
# matched the transcription/ source package and silently kept the whole
# package out of the repository. The patterns below name a second path
# component, which the source package does not have, so they cannot
# collide with it again.
/Transcription/ScriptSync/
/Transcription/Timecoded/
/Transcription/Subtitles/
*.mov
*.mp4
*.wav
